WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.990
So all of the lies from the administration
about the Russian bounty story have completely

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:08.069
imploded and fallen apart.

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:12.870
And the reason that they've fallen apart is
that even if the lies were true, they would

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.510
only expose new problems.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:16.170
So let me give you an example.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:21.740
If Trump really hadn't been briefed about
the Russian bounty's situation, that's the

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.740
problem.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.859
Why wasn't he briefed?

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:28.640
That would be an absolute and total disaster,
given that we know the topic got to the National

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:34.570
Security Council if the Russian bounty situation
was in his presidential daily briefing months

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.570
ago.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.070
Why doesn't he remember?

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.750
Is it a memory problem?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.230
That's also a huge problem.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:47.000
In other words, the explanations we've heard
so far, if true, would all just be indicative

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.329
of additional new and even bigger problems.

00:00:49.329 --> 00:00:55.239
And to sort of reset the story, the news broke
over the weekend that there were reportedly

00:00:55.239 --> 00:00:56.260
Russian bounties.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:00.989
These are like cash bonuses offered to Taliban
linked fighters if they were able to kill

00:01:00.989 --> 00:01:03.390
U.S. or coalition troops in Afghanistan.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.189
They would get a cash bonus, OK.

00:01:05.189 --> 00:01:07.560
That's absolutely and utterly insane.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:14.509
Initially, the White House was silent for
I believe it was 24 hours.

00:01:14.509 --> 00:01:17.200
Trump was not briefed about it.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:23.700
We were told multiple reports came out later
that Trump had been briefed as early as 2019

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.819
to as recently as spring.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:32.029
And eventually we got to the specific claim
that the bounty report was in his presidential

00:01:32.029 --> 00:01:34.079
daily briefing in February.

00:01:34.079 --> 00:01:38.890
So at a press briefing yesterday, Donald Trump's
press secretary, Kaili McEnany, was asked,

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.689
why isn't Trump reading the PDB?

00:01:40.689 --> 00:01:42.549
In other words, if it was in there?

00:01:42.549 --> 00:01:44.290
And Trump doesn't know about it.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:45.290
Is he not reading it?

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:46.460
Does he not remember?

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:53.329
And Caylee goes bonkers, saying Trump is the
most informed person on the planet on issues

00:01:53.329 --> 00:01:55.740
related to threats against the United States.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:56.740
Take a listen.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:01.539
Asking you to defend why the president isn't
necessarily reading his PDB when there are

00:02:01.539 --> 00:02:04.439
these sorts of issues that the president does
read.

00:02:04.439 --> 00:02:07.520
And he also consumes intelligence virtually.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.550
This president, I'll tell you, is the most
informed person on planet Earth when it comes

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:12.890
to the threats that we face.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:18.310
You have Ambassador O'Brien, who sees him
in person twice a day, who sometimes takes

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:21.579
the upwards of half a dozen calls with this
president.

00:02:21.579 --> 00:02:25.860
He's constantly being informed and briefed
on intelligence matters.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:30.159
But I'm not going to allow The New York Times
to dictate when we give top secret information

00:02:30.159 --> 00:02:35.319
and don't give top secret information, just
absolute minimal proposition there.

00:02:35.319 --> 00:02:39.459
The lie falls apart when you go too far.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:45.340
When Trump once said, I am the least racist
person in the world, it was too hyperbolic,

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:46.340
right?

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.340
Just say you're not racist.

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:51.239
It would be not believable if you're Trump,
but it would be more believable than I'm the

00:02:51.239 --> 00:02:53.260
least racist person in the world.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:54.680
Same thing here.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:59.819
Trump is the most informed person in the world
on threats to America.

00:02:59.819 --> 00:03:02.780
He doesn't even read his own presidential
daily briefings.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:06.689
Just say he's informed, like just be less
hyperbolic.

00:03:06.689 --> 00:03:09.629
And it would be less obviously unbelievable.

00:03:09.629 --> 00:03:16.150
And I think that the sort of key reminder
here is let's not take our eye off the ball.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:22.709
The three key points about the Russian bounty
story are, number one, they seem to have lied

00:03:22.709 --> 00:03:23.709
again.

00:03:23.709 --> 00:03:28.620
Trump was briefed or told about this in some
way, shape or form, multiple sources and allegations

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.599
that he was told either in 2019 or February
of this year or the spring of this year or

00:03:33.599 --> 00:03:34.829
in all of those instances.

00:03:34.829 --> 00:03:35.829
That's number one.

00:03:35.829 --> 00:03:36.829
That's really important.

00:03:36.829 --> 00:03:37.829
They lied again.

00:03:37.829 --> 00:03:43.099
Number two, the lies they told, if true, are
only indicative of other arguably just as

00:03:43.099 --> 00:03:46.609
big problems like why wouldn't Trump have
been briefed about it?

00:03:46.609 --> 00:03:52.519
Number three, Trump was briefed and he still
wanted Russia back in the G7 to make it the

00:03:52.519 --> 00:03:53.519
G8.

00:03:53.519 --> 00:03:59.139
He still withheld arms from Ukraine that they
would have used to defend themselves against

00:03:59.139 --> 00:04:00.450
Russian aggression.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.029
That's absolutely crazy.

00:04:02.029 --> 00:04:05.470
And I guess number four, I said it was three
things, but there's four.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.340
Trump has certainly been briefed by now.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.340
Right.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.029
We know now he's been briefed.

00:04:10.029 --> 00:04:13.859
So now the question is, what is he going to
do about it now that he's been briefed and

00:04:13.859 --> 00:04:15.141
without a doubt knows about it?

00:04:15.141 --> 00:04:16.209
And the answer is nothing.

00:04:16.209 --> 00:04:19.989
Trump actually tweeted this morning, I don't
have the tweet handy, but he essentially tweeted,

00:04:19.989 --> 00:04:21.310
he doesn't believe the story.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:25.550
Like he's he's just dismissing the story,
despite the fact that we have officials of

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.389
all kinds saying it's a credible story.

00:04:27.389 --> 00:04:28.400
It's a real story.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.580
It's a story we should believe.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.020
So that's just as important.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:34.770
Trump now has been briefed.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.770
Doing something?

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:36.930
No, he's not doing anything.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.139
He's just dismissing the story as completely
fake.

00:04:40.139 --> 00:04:43.919
Those are the main four points that we should
be thinking about.

00:04:43.919 --> 00:04:51.590
Again, when we recognize the importance of
removing this terror as we get closer and

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:52.119
closer to November,

